# Text normalisation.
#
# The install script has to arrive on the server with Unix line endings. A
# stray carriage return makes bash fail with "bad interpreter" or
# "\r: command not found", which is a confusing way to lose an afternoon.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf
*.example text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary